    <string name="local_adb_guide_message">Follow these steps once to enable automation:\n\n1. Settings → About phone → tap \"Build number\" 7 times to enable Developer options.\n2. Settings → Developer options → Wireless debugging → turn it on.\n3. Tap \"Pair device with pairing code\". A 6-digit code appears.\n4. Keep that dialog open, return to BQAAgent, and enter the 6-digit code. The port is detected automatically.\n5. Wait for \"Paired and connected\".\n\nNote: You only need the 6-digit code. Do not close the system pairing dialog until it succeeds.</string>

